{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-4","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"bevor · Wohnen 2","bn":"আগে · বাসস্থান ২"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„bevor“ মানে কী?","options":["যদিও","আগে","পরে"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-4-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Bevor ich ___, putze ich meine Zähne. (schlafen)","options":["schläfst","schlafen","schlafe"],"answer":2,"explanation":"bevor-এর অংশে verb শেষে: ich … schlafe।","id":"b1-practice-4-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Bevor ich zur Arbeit gehe, frühstücke ich.“ মানে কী?","options":["কাজে যাওয়ার আগে আমি নাশতা করি।","কাজে যাওয়ার পরে আমি নাশতা করি।","কাজে যাওয়ার সময় আমি নাশতা করি।"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-4-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich rufe dich an, ___ ich komme. (আগে)","options":["obwohl","bevor","während"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-4-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Tiefgarage“ মানে কী?","options":["সিঁড়িঘর","বহুতল ভবন","আন্ডারগ্রাউন্ড গ্যারেজ"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-4-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Steckdose“ মানে কী?","options":["সকেট","বাথটাব","বেসিন"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-4-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Treppenhaus“ মানে কী?","options":["শহরের এলাকা","সিঁড়িঘর","সারি ঘর"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-4-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Haustier“ মানে কী?","options":["যানবাহন","স্বপ্নের বাড়ি","পোষা প্রাণী"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-4-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Badewanne“ মানে কী?","options":["বাথটাব","বেসিন","সকেট"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-4-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Hochhaus“ মানে কী?","options":["সারি ঘর","বসতি","বহুতল ভবন"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-4-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Während ich ___, hört mein Mann Radio. (kochen)","options":["koche","kochst","kochen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"während-এর অংশে verb শেষে।","id":"b1-practice-4-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Obwohl die Wohnung teuer ist, ___ wir sie.","options":["nimmt","nehmen","wir nehmen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"obwohl-অংশ আগে → কমার পরেই verb।","id":"b1-prac